This product is a Rust port of system logic from Cairo Desktop's ManagedShell
(https://github.com/cairoshell/ManagedShell), licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
Files derived from ManagedShell are marked as such in their headers.

The reading of Start button art strips (crates/jtb-core/src/startart.rs) follows the button
loading code of Open-Shell (https://github.com/Open-Shell/Open-Shell-Menu), MIT licensed,
Copyright (c) 2009-2017 Ivo Beltchev, (c) 2017-2018 The Open-Shell Team. No Open-Shell
artwork is included; users supply their own button image.

The volume bars (crates/jtb-core/src/widgeticon.rs) are the CC0 "Volume Level Indicator" drawing
from SVG Repo (https://www.svgrepo.com/svg/64394/volume-level-indicator).

The battery icon (crates/jtb-core/src/widgeticon.rs) is modeled on the design of the "Phone battery
charge status flat symbols set" by pch.vector (https://www.magnific.com/author/pch-vector), a
free license that requires attribution. No artwork from the set is included; the icon is drawn
in code.
